      "body_plain": "Hi,\n\nI'm trying to fit a growth model using blavaan and am getting a PPP value in my output of NA. The rhat values in the output suggest my chains in MCMC have converged. I have time series data (music performance) with 127 time points. Below is the model I've specified in blavaan:\n\nLGM <- '\ni =~ 1*T1 + 1*T2 + 1*T3 + 1*T4 + 1*T5 +1*T6 + 1*T7 + 1*T8 + 1*T9 + 1*T10 + 1*T11 + 1*T12 + 1*T13 + 1*T14 +\n1*T15 + 1*T16 + 1*T17 + 1*T18 +1*T19 + 1*T20 + 1*T21 + 1*T22 + 1*T23 + 1*T24 +1*T25 + 1*T26 + 1*T27 + 1*T28 +\n1*T29 + 1*T30 + 1*T31 + 1*T32 + 1*T33 + 1*T34 + 1*T35 + 1*T36 + 1*T37 + 1*T38 + 1*T39 + 1*T40 +\n1*T41 + 1*T42 + 1*T43 + 1*T44 + 1*T45 + 1*T46 + 1*T47 + 1*T48 + 1*T49 +1*T50 + 1*T51 + 1*T52 + 1*T53 +\n1*T54 + 1*T55 + 1*T56 + 1*T57 + 1*T58 + 1*T59 + 1*T60 + 1*T61 + 1*T62 + 1*T63 + 1*T64 + 1*T65 +\n1*T66 + 1*T67 + 1*T68 + 1*T69 + 1*T70 + 1*T71 + 1*T72 + 1*T73 + 1*T74 + 1*T75 + 1*T76 + 1*T77 + 1*T78 +\n1*T79 + 1*T80 + 1*T81 + 1*T82 + 1*T83 + 1*T84 + 1*T85 + 1*T86 + 1*T87 + 1*T88 + 1*T89 + 1*T90 +\n1*T91 + 1*T92 + 1*T93 + 1*T94 + 1*T95 + 1*T96 + 1*T97 + 1*T98 + 1*T99 + 1*T100 + 1*T101 + 1*T102 + 1*T103 +\n1*T104 + 1*T105 + 1*T106 + 1*T107 + 1*T108 + 1*T109 + 1*T110 + 1*T111 + 1*T112 + 1*T113 + 1*T114 + 1*T115 +\n1*T116 + 1*T117 + 1*T118 + 1*T119 + 1*T120 + 1*T121 + 1*T122 + 1*T123 + 1*T124 + 1*T125 + 1*T126 + 1*T127\n\ns =~ 0*T1 + 1*T2 + 2*T3 + 3*T4 + 4*T5 +5*T6 + 6*T7 + 7*T8 + 8*T9 + 9*T10 + 10*T11 + 11*T12 + 12*T13 + 13*T14 +\n14*T15 + 15*T16 + 16*T17 + 17*T18 +18*T19 + 19*T20 + 20*T21 + 21*T22 + 22*T23 + 23*T24 + 24*T25 + 25*T26 + 26*T27 + 27*T28 +\n28*T29 + 29*T30 + 30*T31 + 31*T32 + 32*T33 + 33*T34 + 34*T35 + 35*T36 + 36*T37 + 37*T38 + 38*T39 + 39*T40 +\n40*T41 + 41*T42 + 42*T43 + 43*T44 + 44*T45 + 45*T46 + 46*T47 + 47*T48 + 48*T49 +49*T50 + 50*T51 + 51*T52 + 52*T53 +\n53*T54 + 54*T55 + 55*T56 + 56*T57 + 57*T58 + 58*T59 + 59*T60 + 60*T61 + 61*T62 + 62*T63 + 63*T64 + 64*T65 +\n65*T66 + 66*T67 + 67*T68 + 68*T69 + 69*T70 + 70*T71 + 71*T72 +